      "text": "In Section 9, we study F◦ by justifying this reasoning. In particular, as Lemma 9.3, we conﬁrm that F◦Fju˜(x) is negative for |x| ≥ Ct2 and bound it away from zero. The contribution from |x| ≤ Ct2 might be positive, so we also provide a bound on this quantity in the same Lemma 9.3, using (1.8). Throughout these analyses, we make repeated use of (1.11), to bound high powers of Fs,E applied to u˜ by a multiple of vs,E (on which Fs,E acts diagonally).",
